#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = vores netes a la mida de renderització del joc. DLSS = el mateix, i escala quan l'Escala "
"del joc és inferior al 100 %. desactivat = la imatge del joc, per comparar. Es desa a l'instant."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Perfils per a la teva GPU. alt = tot activat (model 1). mitjà = model 2, profunditat translúcida "
"a mitja resolució, retrovisors plans sense moviment de peces, cerca de moviment més lleugera. "
"baix = també sense DLAA als retrovisors, sense profunditat translúcida, àrea VR 60 %. Mai canvia "
"el que has ajustat."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = més detall, text més nítid, uns 1,6x la GPU del 2. 2 (E) = equilibrat, menys rastre "
"darrere del trànsit: comença aquí. 3 (F) = més calmat en tanques i cables, pot esborronar detall "
"en moviment, mateix cost que el 2. 4 (M) = el més pesat (uns 5x), només per a proves en pantalla "
"plana."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Qualitat d'imatge: nitidesa, nitidesa de textura, àrea del DLAA i profunditat translúcida. Dreta "
"obre el grup, Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Augmenta la nitidesa després del DLAA, de 0 (desactivat) a 1,0. Puja-la si la imatge es veu suau; "
"massa alt fa halos clars a les vores. Costa uns 0,1 ms; 0 se salta el pas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Abast de la nitidesa, d'1 a 4 px: petit = detall fi, gran = vores més marcades. Canvia-ho si la "
"nitidesa sembla massa fina o gruixuda; una imatge més gran que la pantalla, com en VR, necessita "
"més d'1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Text de textura més nítid (senyals, tauler, GPS). 0 = desactivat; més negatiu = més nítid però "
"més parpelleig a les tanques; prova -0,5 a -1 si el text es veu borrós. Sense cost de GPU, només "
"una mica d'ample de banda."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"El mateix per a tanques de filferro, herba i retalls de fulles: puja cap a 0 si les tanques "
"parpellegen, baixa si l'herba es veu suau. igual = segueix la fila de dalt. Només actua si la "
"Nitidesa de textura no és 0. Sense cost de GPU."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: només el centre de cada ull rep DLAA (20 a 100 %); la vora conserva la imatge del joc. "
"Baixa-ho per permetre't un model més pesat o guanyar fps; 40 % costa uns 40 % del model. També "
"fixa el camió del garatge / menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Només pantalla plana: DLAA abans del bloom / tonemap del joc, perquè línies, cables i rails "
"parpellegin menys. Canvia-ho només per comparar. No val amb upscale DLSS ni HDR de Windows. "
"Mateix cost; triga ~60 fotogrames a canviar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Dona a cables, tanques i vidres la seva pròpia distància en lloc de la del fons, perquè no "
"s'esborronin en moure't. Desactiva-ho si no hi veus esborronat: estalvia 0,02 - 0,06 ms per ull."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Evita que el resplendor de fanals i llums de cotxe deixi rastre en moure't: el DLSS agafa cada "
"resplendor del fotograma actual, no de l'historial. Passos del 25 %; baixa-ho si els resplendors "
"parpellegen, 0 = desactivat. Costa uns 0,05 - 0,2 ms per ull."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Com el DLAA tracta les peces en moviment i els retrovisors del camió. Dreta obre el grup, "
"Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Dona a cada peça mòbil (trànsit, rodes, matrícules) el seu propi moviment per al DLAA, perquè es "
"mantingui nítida i sense rastre. Desactiva-ho només per estalviar uns 0,5 ms per ull o per "
"provar: cada píxel segueix la càmera i el trànsit s'esborrona."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Dona als retrovisors el seu propi DLAA perquè no parpellegin. 1 retrovisor = només el més gran "
"(el principal al teu costat). tots = cada retrovisor. càmera = més barat per mirall, el trànsit "
"pot deixar rastre al vidre; si no, cada peça es mou ben bé al vidre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"activat = cada retrovisor rep el DLAA cada 2 fotogrames i mostra la darrera imatge neta entre "
"mig: uns la meitat del cost. Vores netes; el que es mou al vidre s'actualitza a mitja taxa. "
"desactivat = cada retrovisor a cada fotograma."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Els cables fins conserven el moviment mentre condueixes: el DLAA escampa les dades de moviment "
"per les línies fines (dilatació de moviment del DLSS). activat = per defecte. desactivat = només "
"per comparar; els cables propers parpellegen més. La imatge es veu suau un instant en canviar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Els cables fins reben profunditat a cada píxel que toquen, no només on cobreixen el centre del "
"píxel. activat = per defecte. activat (no A2C) = també en vores translúcides. desactivat = només "
"per comparar; els cables propers parpellegen més."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Experimental: dibuixa els cables llunyans més fins d'1 píxel com a línia d'1 píxel, perquè no es "
"trenquin en trossos. Desactivat per defecte: els cables llunyans poden veure's més foscos o "
"parpellejar més. Prova-ho i compara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Upscale DLSS, l'interruptor d'activar / desactivar el DLAA i la info de l'OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. "
"Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"El DLSS redibuixa la imatge a mida completa quan l'Escala del joc és inferior al 100 %: més nítid "
"que l'estirament del joc, i menys píxels vol dir més fps. Sense cost extra; no fa res amb Escala "
"100 %."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Activa o desactiva tot el mod i en conserva el mode; desactivat mostra la imatge del joc, per "
"comparar. Desactivat estalvia el cost de totes les parts juntes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = generació de fotogrames en VR de djules75, descàrrega a part "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). trobat = la seva capa està carregada en aquest joc i el mod "
"deixa passar la seva feina. Inicia la seva app de la safata abans del joc."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = un conjunt de millores OpenXR de DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"profunditat, generació de fotogrames; trobat = la seva capa està carregada al joc i el mod deixa "
"passar la seva feina. Fes servir un sol Turbo (el seu o el del mod)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Acceleracions VR: Turbo, renderització foveada i la màscara d'àrea oculta. Dreta obre el grup, "
"Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: sense ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojecció. Només VR. Activat = el joc deixa "
"d'esperar el visor a cada fotograma: més fps només quan la CPU és el límit (ciutats plenes, "
"trànsit). Desactiva-ho si la imatge va a batzegades. De l'OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Centre nítid, menys detall a la vora (només NVIDIA RTX). Estalvia GPU amb Escala alta. Només VR. "
"L'anell exterior s'ombreja un cop per 2 x 2 píxels; tanques, herba i fulles conserven el detall. "
"Desactiva-ho si la vora es veu a blocs."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Mida del centre nítid del Foveated (VRS), 10 - 100 % en passos de 5 %: més gran = més vista "
"nítida, menys estalvi; més petit = més estalvi, menys detall a prop del mig. 80 % (equilibrat) és "
"el per defecte; 90 = ample, 65 = estret."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"En quins passos del joc actua el Foveated (VRS). escena = només el món 3D (per defecte). escena + "
"il·luminació = també la il·luminació, només a la vora extrema: més estalvi. Prova-ho: busca vores "
"de llum o ombra a blocs als costats de la vista."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Com de gruixut és l'anell exterior del Foveated (VRS). Normal = 1 color per 2 x 2 píxels (per "
"defecte). Fort = per 4 x 2, Màx = per 4 x 4: més estalvi de GPU, vores a blocs. Millor amb eye "
"tracking, on mai mires l'anell exterior."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Experimental. El centre nítid del Foveated (VRS) segueix els teus ulls en un visor amb eye "
"tracking (mirada OpenXR, p. ex. Varjo); sense, es queda al centre de la lent. Cal el Foveated "
"(VRS) activat en iniciar el joc, si no reinicia. Gairebé sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Només VR. El joc se salta les cantonades de la lent que mai veus (el visor les informa), dibuixa "
"menys píxels: més marge de GPU, la imatge que veus és la mateixa. La primera activació demana "
"reiniciar el joc. Desactiva-ho si la vora de la vista es veu estranya."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Límits de taxa de fotogrames i CPU: NVIDIA Reflex i límit de FPS per a pantalla plana, límit de "
"FPS VR, ajust de la CPU. Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que "
"s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Només pantalla plana, només NVIDIA. Activat = els fotogrames del joc esperen menys a la cua de la "
"GPU: menys input lag quan la GPU és el límit. Boost també manté alts els rellotges de la GPU. "
"Mateixos fps; cost petit. No s'usa en VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Només pantalla plana. Limita el joc com a màxim a aquesta taxa: temps de fotograma estable, menys "
"calor i consum. Posa-ho una mica per sota del que el teu PC sosté en una ciutat plena. Amb Reflex "
"activat, ho limita el controlador NVIDIA. desactivat = sense límit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Només VR. meitat = el joc dibuixa 1 de cada 2 fotogrames del visor (72 Hz -> 36 fps), terç = 1 de "
"cada 3; la reprojecció del visor (ASW / Motion Smoothing) omple la resta a ritme estable. Fes-ho "
"servir si els fps oscil·len. Desactiva el Turbo mentre és actiu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tres ajustos de CPU junts: els fils principal i de render prefereixen els P-cores (només CPU "
"híbrides Intel), el joc corre amb prioritat Per sobre del normal, i Windows no el pot limitar "
"(EcoQoS) ni ignorar els seus temporitzadors. Ajuda si la CPU és el límit; sense cost. Ajustos "
"separats al dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Posició, mida, profunditat i orientació del panell, i les tecles del menú. Dreta obre el grup, "
"Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR. Seguir el cap = el panell segueix el visor. Fix a la cabina = es queda en un punt "
"davant del teu seient, estable quan mires al voltant; X / Y / profunditat fixen aquest punt "
"(graus, metres). Cal la capa VR (per defecte). Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mou aquest panell als costats, en % de la pantalla (VR fix a la cabina: graus al voltant del "
"seient). Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva posició. Fes-ho servir si el panell tapa "
"alguna cosa que necessites. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mou aquest panell amunt / avall, en % de la pantalla (VR fix a la cabina: graus, més = avall). "
"Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva posició. Fes-ho servir si el panell tapa alguna cosa "
"que necessites. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fa aquest panell més gran o més petit. Puja-ho si no pots llegir-lo, baixa-ho si tapa massa. "
"Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva mida. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. A quina distància flota el panell: en metres (0,30 - 3,00) "
"com a capa VR, per defecte; en px de desplaçament per ull amb menu_vr_layer = 0. Mateixa mida a "
"qualsevol profunditat. Canvia-ho si cansa mirar-lo. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Activat = el panell es gira cap a tu quan el mous cap al "
"costat, mateixa mida des de qualsevol angle (com a capa VR, per defecte, també el quadre de fps "
"que segueix el cap); desactivat = imatge plana. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"Un petit quadre de fps i temps de fotograma en directe, també amb aquest menú tancat (pla i VR). "
"Fes-lo servir per veure què guanya un ajust. El cost de GPU es mesura: per fotograma, cada imatge "
"on es dibuixa; cap en desactivat. Desar el conserva per al proper inici."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fixació, posició, mida, color, distància VR i gir del quadre de fps. Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra "
"el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR. Seguir el cap = segueix el visor. Fix a l'àrea de joc = un punt al voltant del teu "
"seient, ignora el balanceig de la cabina. Enganxat al vehicle = enganxat a la cabina, es "
"balanceja amb ella (cal DLAA + vectors de moviment per peça). Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, només Enganxat al vehicle. Activat = cada camió / cotxe conserva el lloc del seu quadre de "
"fps a la cabina, gir, mida, color, brillantor i text (es desa al dlaa.ini en tancar el menú). "
"Desactivat = un sol conjunt per a tots els vehicles. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, només Enganxat al vehicle. Dreta = mesurar la cabina de nou ara (quiet, aparcat) si el quadre "
"queda fora de lloc. Esquerra = el quadre d'aquest vehicle torna al per defecte (lloc, gir, mida, "
"color, text); els altres vehicles conserven el seu. El quadre queda recte amb la cabina."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mou el quadre de fps als costats, en % de la pantalla (VR fix / enganxat: graus al teu voltant). "
"Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva posició. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mou el quadre de fps amunt / avall, en % de la pantalla (VR fix / enganxat: graus, menys = "
"amunt). Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva posició. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Gira el quadre de fps a esquerra / dreta, en graus (+ = la "
"cara gira a la dreta). Fes-ho servir per orientar el quadre quan és al costat. 0 = et mira de "
"cara. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Inclina el quadre de fps, en graus (+ = la part de dalt "
"s'allunya de tu, com estirat al panell). 0 = et mira de cara. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Gira el quadre de fps en el seu propi pla, en graus (+ = "
"sentit horari). 0 = dret. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fa el quadre de fps més gran o més petit (0,2 .. 3,0). Puja-ho si no pots llegir-lo al visor o en "
"una pantalla gran. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"El color del text del quadre de fps: 20 colors, cadascun amb contorn per llegir-se sobre "
"qualsevol imatge (negre sobre blanc = text fosc, contorn blanc). Pla i VR. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Brillantor del quadre de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = el color tal qual, menys enfosqueix el text (el "
"contorn es queda) cap al negre. Fes-ho servir per abaixar el comptador de nit o al visor. Pla i "
"VR. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Com de translúcid és tot el quadre de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = sòlid, menys esvaeix el text I el "
"seu contorn negre alhora, perquè no es faci una taca negra. Pla i VR. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. A quina distància flota el quadre de fps, 0,30 - 3,00 m. "
"Manté la mateixa mida a la vista a qualsevol distància; només canvia la profunditat. Posa'l prop "
"de la profunditat on mires per llegir-lo sense reenfocar. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Què va al dlaa_inject.log: desactivat = res; errors = només errors (per defecte); avisos = + "
"problemes esquivats; info = + inici i canvis; depuració = + estadístiques, i depuració també "
"activa els temporitzadors de la GPU i el profiler de la CPU."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"L'idioma d'aquest menú. auto = l'idioma del joc (per defecte); Esquerra / Dreta en tria un altre. "
"Linux / Proton: el xinès, japonès i coreà necessiten les seves fonts instal·lades, mira el "
"README. Un fitxer lang\\<code>.po al costat de la DLL té prioritat, per a les teves correccions. "
"Desar el conserva. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Totes les dreceres d'aquest menú, una línia per acció, amb la tecla del teclat i el botó del "
"comandament. Dreta obre la llista; tria una acció amb Dreta i prem la tecla o botó del volant "
"nou. Es desa al dlaa.ini a l'instant."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Escriu tot el que es veu aquí al dlaa.ini (ajustos, i les posicions del panell / quadre de fps un "
"cop mogudes), conservant les altres línies. Fes-ho quan t'agradi el resultat, o els canvis es "
"perden a l'inici següent. El mode es desa sol."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Torna tots els ajustos d'aquest menú a com els porta el mod (model, nitidesa, nitidesa de "
"textura, àrea DLAA, moviment, retrovisors, perfil, panell, quadre de fps, turbo, foveated, taxa "
"de fotogrames, registre), en directe i al dlaa.ini, conservant les teves dreceres i les altres "
"línies."

