"consultes de timestamp)"

#. Performance line at the top (one line, small font)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "this mod: %lc%ls%lc | - ms -- nothing for the GPU on this screen; it works while you drive"
msgstr ""
"aquest mod: %lc%ls%lc | - ms -- res per a la GPU en aquesta pantalla; funciona mentre condueixes"

#. Performance line at the top (one line, small font)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
